      "uid": "zhcn:5282b097fcbce9e6844ac3f7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "相互理解的思想，与无法沟通的秘密。\r\n虽仍是与某些东西擦肩而过——",
      "source_fingerprint": "cda87ac871cf7218aee1507cdaea8bf5d906ceea5de0010fa9d6a62fbdfa0014",
