      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但新宇宙，总算在荒漠英雄的陪伴之下，\r\n成功地穿越了第一个星间陷阱。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e3011730ff4ce40fcd7ff5e850920750583582eb4c2c2d8bb3b48cbca6d73eb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
