      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——这一日的归途上。\r\n比赛时的激情仍未散去，\r\n我们决定绕道顺便散散步……",
      "source_fingerprint": "927ef140eaede1096d92fb3894715e0aa9a253a9025fe1f7eb073d3a84cbcd48",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
