    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce609cfd2e088653821e7e93",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是，有这样感觉的并不只是新宇宙一人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "35901426e036f7121f183a65d443bfb274315977496d4813cf5cd22f7c4184be",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105310.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8df4b7418e8a606aef720a21",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "经典三冠的有力竞争者在经典级选择参加『宝\r\n冢纪念』，的确相当少见。要问为什么的话……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a77bdd409054b0ca389c6be80b78c49ab218fcf04965f0a235ba4a2c466a8caf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105310.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        40,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/40/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c3875b27a10cd2d293ba018",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这实在是太过胡来了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9315a9c317ba21b37a68480da42dbbf5cd9e6b8a561443d4943dc0124747bdd0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105310.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        41,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/41/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:063b2887d2992c8eb95eee92",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这意味着，短短一个月之内连战两场GⅠ级赛事。\r\n而且参加『宝冢纪念』的大多是实力雄厚的古马\r\n级赛马娘，对经典级的她而言实在是压力过大。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a356871cfa55ef2080648d41b96de2490f003aea0f33862c0eea5237f089b98b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
